The north parking lot will be repaved next week. Work will begin on Monday, September 9, and is expected to {{135}} by Thursday. During this time, the north lot will be closed to all vehicles.

Employees who usually park in the north lot should use the south lot {{136}}. Because the south lot has fewer spaces, we encourage staff to carpool or take public transportation if possible. {{137}}

We understand that this may cause some {{138}}, and we thank you for your patience.
